      "snippet": "## 3. What does NDVI Represent? The **Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI)** is a dimensionless radiometric index that quantitatively measures chlorophyll concentration, photosynthetic capacity, and canopy biomass density: $$NDVI = \\frac{\\rho_{NIR} - \\rho_{Red}}{\\rho_{NIR} + \\rho_{Red}}$$"
